{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_02f5fd2c253e825e0a8aa44d8a1b96febc49c05efaae643680fe09485b17989e"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Work routing is based on decision burden rather than file count: Small work runs directly, Medium requires design and a work plan, Large requires a PRD with separate design decisions."},{"claim_ids":["clm_0b825dc8e3ed9bbf076d2fe22a1588f596b5baaf8223e691b1c703c0684f5a4e"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Skills hold reusable judgment for coding, testing, documentation, implementation strategy, and metacognition, and are loaded only when a selected task needs them rather than at startup."},{"claim_ids":["clm_1940a2f98617d0f6b71bd0a0ae9310b26ebb10fedeac57b20bdb6e9f35c5a7be"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The workflow is strict about requirements, user authority, irreversible actions, accepted durable decisions, and completion evidence, while letting the agent resolve reversible repository-local choices itself."},{"claim_ids":["clm_828fce4a09620854a69b2f42493983cf37b2e73f7cb02c9a1a142caab89be8df"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The workflow targets tools that read repository-level AGENTS.md instructions, with Cursor, Codex CLI, and Gemini CLI cited as common examples, and exact discovery behavior depends on tool version."},{"claim_ids":["clm_940dff58a86bc5f6ae54f44aa4fe75d95ee06bd0a8ab380df4e5ee377f8452c5"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The core is language-agnostic but TypeScript-specific references are included; other languages rely on repository-native commands until language-specific guidance is added."},{"claim_ids":["clm_a51b632c4c0307e4d78e93045120506aa215ebda0ac0a805e32ed4107a8792ce"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The framework adds process and context overhead, so direct agent execution is usually cheaper for well-scoped fixes, disposable experiments, or one-shot scripts with clear safe boundaries."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b33a47b64c8836d7cfcedd04334edf1e0709f31a18c91aa990b6a9da9bb1dfa2"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The package ships an AGENTS.md entry point plus .agents directories for tasks, workflows, skills, and context-maps mapping tasks to skills."},{"claim_ids":["clm_cf72b2dbd166de8a4b2adec7a290147922ff4675f9b97dd1991126d7e1a83d26"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Defined tasks include task-analysis, prd-creation, technical-design, acceptance-test-generation, work-planning, implementation, quality-assurance, code-review, technical-document-review, and integration-test-review, each owning one kind of result."},{"claim_ids":["clm_d325936df5b0a2204e2f97f3534c69b2d7ed42415d4d04f8db8c6a703cccfc20"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A workflow file, .agents/workflows/agentic-coding.md, coordinates Medium/Large work across requirements, design, planning, implementation, QA, and review while preserving the approved outcome."},{"claim_ids":["clm_d7273e45d6be4e3b40fa1d09d146ea6cee2a296c5d7239522b38575eff827689"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The tool requires Node.js 22 or later, per the Quick Start section."},{"claim_ids":["clm_da31861f806aa9555077f0478e224a7048ad3050780a9c5f08fa20b942433fac"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The skills subcommand installs only .agents/skills/ and does not install the full AGENTS.md workflow."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ee74d541f0ff2c4eb3ed33185826a9450349a6549f9bcf7b77eac6bbd78662eb"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The CLI is invoked as npx agentic-code with a project name to scaffold a repository, and a skills subcommand supporting --codex, --cursor, --project, and --path options."}],"claim_ids":["clm_02f5fd2c253e825e0a8aa44d8a1b96febc49c05efaae643680fe09485b17989e","clm_0b825dc8e3ed9bbf076d2fe22a1588f596b5baaf8223e691b1c703c0684f5a4e","clm_1940a2f98617d0f6b71bd0a0ae9310b26ebb10fedeac57b20bdb6e9f35c5a7be","clm_828fce4a09620854a69b2f42493983cf37b2e73f7cb02c9a1a142caab89be8df","clm_940dff58a86bc5f6ae54f44aa4fe75d95ee06bd0a8ab380df4e5ee377f8452c5","clm_a51b632c4c0307e4d78e93045120506aa215ebda0ac0a805e32ed4107a8792ce","clm_b33a47b64c8836d7cfcedd04334edf1e0709f31a18c91aa990b6a9da9bb1dfa2","clm_cf72b2dbd166de8a4b2adec7a290147922ff4675f9b97dd1991126d7e1a83d26","clm_d325936df5b0a2204e2f97f3534c69b2d7ed42415d4d04f8db8c6a703cccfc20","clm_d7273e45d6be4e3b40fa1d09d146ea6cee2a296c5d7239522b38575eff827689","clm_da31861f806aa9555077f0478e224a7048ad3050780a9c5f08fa20b942433fac","clm_ee74d541f0ff2c4eb3ed33185826a9450349a6549f9bcf7b77eac6bbd78662eb"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:20:37Z","created_by_operation":"op_c5960bdf64bb48d3a74f2944dcddaf85","id":"pg_035a61a4afe159a18e90b24c26827221","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/shinpr-agentic-code-readme-md-a3f058520173-b24c26827221.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_cc7ad8ffcefc5c52a494a009f2725925"],"title":"shinpr/agentic-code/README.md @ a3f058520173","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:20:37Z","updated_by_operation":"op_c5960bdf64bb48d3a74f2944dcddaf85"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_387ce9b27fceff70365e2f48e32a6c33eba90226dce597c29137528f0e6486ec"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: review findings are treated as candidates to apply, decline, or return for user decision, and a repeated preference without new evidence does not block progress."},{"claim_ids":["clm_5b6c0343738355956eaaf67a877742cfb739e3ce720fb152d79a581e1258fe02"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: before completion the agent must confirm outcome and exit conditions, run applicable repository checks, record verification evidence and remaining limitations, and update affected documentation."},{"claim_ids":["clm_c52a90e4d63c359feaa94f4c7c34fffbc0c3531d060dad71d8c88c6e2d5cb8ec"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: the installed AGENTS.md instructs the agent to inspect project structure, load the metacognition skill for the session, and route requests through task-analysis or direct execution before loading task definitions."}],"claim_ids":["clm_387ce9b27fceff70365e2f48e32a6c33eba90226dce597c29137528f0e6486ec","clm_5b6c0343738355956eaaf67a877742cfb739e3ce720fb152d79a581e1258fe02","clm_c52a90e4d63c359feaa94f4c7c34fffbc0c3531d060dad71d8c88c6e2d5cb8ec"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:20:37Z","created_by_operation":"op_c5960bdf64bb48d3a74f2944dcddaf85","id":"pg_05e1e9569f195af7ad370515f11f8476","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/shinpr-agentic-code-agents-md-a3f058520173-0515f11f8476.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_c49ae7cee76254cf84308d649a4eb62b"],"title":"shinpr/agentic-code/AGENTS.md @ a3f058520173","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:20:37Z","updated_by_operation":"op_c5960bdf64bb48d3a74f2944dcddaf85"}
